      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook and stir ground beef in a skillet over medium-high heat until beef is browned, about 10 minutes. Drain fat. Mix in green beans, cream of mushroom soup, and onion.",
